    "text": "Look at these photos of famous scientists."
  },
  {
    "id": "2",
    "startMs": 20540,
    "endMs": 25180,
    "text": "Oh, this is Tu Youyou, a Nobel Prize winner."
  },
  {
    "id": "3",
    "startMs": 26000,
    "endMs": 26360,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "id": "4",
    "startMs": 27300,
    "endMs": 29280,
    "text": "What do you know about her?"
  },
  {
    "id": "5",
    "startMs": 30340,
    "endMs": 35380,
    "text": "She discovered qinghaosu and has saved many lives."
  },
  {
    "id": "6",
    "startMs": 35380,
    "endMs": 36230,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "id": "7",
    "startMs": 37480,
    "endMs": 38660,
    "text": "She is great!"
  },
  {
    "id": "8",
    "startMs": 43980,
    "endMs": 44720,
    "text": "Look here!"
  },
  {
    "id": "9",
    "startMs": 45420,
    "endMs": 46360,
    "text": "It’s Newton."
  },
  {
    "id": "10",
    "startMs": 47600,
    "endMs": 50540,
    "text": "Do you know the story of “Newton’s apple”?"
  },
  {
    "id": "11",
    "startMs": 51580,
    "endMs": 52300,
    "text": "Yes, I do."
  },
  {
    "id": "12",
    "startMs": 52960,
    "endMs": 54540,
    "text": "The story is like this."
  },
  {
    "id": "14",
    "startMs": 58680,
    "endMs": 60640,
    "text": "Suddenly an apple fell on his head."
  },
  {
    "id": "16",
    "startMs": 65120,
    "endMs": 69460,
    "text": "And later he discovered the Law of Gravity."
  },
  {
    "id": "17",
    "startMs": 69460,
    "endMs": 74840,
    "text": "Look, Qian Xuesen, a rocket scientist."
  },
  {
    "id": "18",
    "startMs": 76120,
    "endMs": 78140,
    "text": "I’m a big fan of him."
  },
  {
    "id": "19",
    "startMs": 79760,
    "endMs": 82100,
    "text": "I’m also interested in outer space."
  },
  {
    "id": "20",
    "startMs": 82840,
    "endMs": 86280,
    "text": "I want to be a scientist like him in the future."
  },
  {
    "id": "21",
    "startMs": 87360,
    "endMs": 89480,
    "text": "Your dream will come true."
  }
